d-91067c43612e&quot;}],&quot;updatedByUserId&quot;:&quot;712f0c75-79d5-4434-9e78-da2e09784df4&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;bc8dabf4-9e49-47f5-82eb-cbd311a1882b&quot;}\" name=\"cards[bc8dabf4-9e49-47f5-82eb-cbd311a1882b][baseTemplate]\"><ul><li class=\"application-question custom-question\"><div><div class=\"application-label full-width multiple-choice\"><div class=\"text\">Are you willing and able to work from our central Hyderabad office location?<span class=\"required\">✱</span></div></div><div class=\"application-field full-width required-field\"><ul data-qa=\"multiple-choice\"><li><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cards[bc8dabf4-9e49-47f5-82eb-cbd311a1882b][field0]\" value=\"Yes\" required=\"required\" /><span class=\"application-answer-alternative\">Yes</span></label></li><li><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cards[bc8dabf4-9e49-47f5-82eb-cbd311a1882b][field0]\" value=\"No\" required=\"required\" /><span class=\"application-answer-alternative\">No</span></label></li></ul></div></div></li><li class=\"application-question custom-question\"><div><div class=\"application-label full-width textarea\"><div class=\"text\">What are your salary expectations?<span class=\"required\">✱</span></div></div><div class=\"application-field full-width required-field\"><textarea class=\"card-field-input\" name=\"cards[bc8dabf4-9e49-47f5-82eb-cbd311a1882b][field1]\" required=\"required\"></textarea></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"section page-centered application-form\" data-qa=\"additional-cards\"><h4 data-qa=\"card-name\">Hyderabad - notice period</h4><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"{&quot;createdAt&quot;:1727083964388,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:1737986442795,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Hyderabad - notice period&quot;,&quot;instructions&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;posting&quot;,&quot;accountId&quot;:&quot;11ffabca-4096-418a-9793-00629e322ce0&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[],&quot;updatedByUserId&quot;:&quot;e2cc2cac-788c-4be7-aaec-ec3f66f76c55&quot;,&quot;deletedAt&quot;:1789630583171,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6307c50b-e18e-48d4-8150-c1e5df3ed861&quot;}\" name=\"cards[6307c50b-e18e-48d4-8150-c1e5df3ed861][baseTemplate]\"><ul></ul></div><div class=\"section page-centered application-form\" id=\"countrySurvey\n\n_all-opportunity-locations\"><hr /><h4 data-qa=\"card-name\">Help support Matillion’s DEI efforts</h4><p>Thank you for your interest in joining # Team Green.\n\nWe are committed to fostering a workplace where every individual, regardless of their background, identity, or perspective, feels valued, respected, and empowered. Our purpose is to cultivate a culture of inclusivity and belonging that drives innovation, fuels collaboration, and reflects the diverse world we serve.\n\nTo help us monitor and evaluate our diversity and inclusion efforts we invite you to complete this strictly optional (and quick) survey. \n\nConfidentiality\nIt is entirely up to you whether you wish to complete this survey. Any data collected is not linked to your name or job application to prevent any form of discrimination or bias. The data will not be used to make individual hiring decisions, and your decision to provide or withhold this information will not impact your application in any way.\n\nHow we use this information\nAll information collected will solely be used to support our evaluation of our diversity and inclusion efforts, and to make improvements where needed. All information will be kept secure and confidential. \n\nThank you for taking the time to complete this survey!\n\nThanks,\nMatillion Talent Acquisition Team\n\nOur privacy policy can be viewed here: https://www.matillion.com/privacy-policy</p><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"{&quot;createdAt&quot;:1706798379929,&quot;updatedAt&quot;:1706798379929,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Help support Matillion’s DEI efforts&quot;,&quot;instructions&quot;:&quot;Thank you for your interest in joining # Team Green.\\n\\nWe are committed to fostering a workplace where every individual, regardless of their background, identity, or perspective, feels valued, respected, and empowered. Our purpose is to cultivate a culture of inclusivity and belonging that drives innovation, fuels collaboration, and reflects the diverse world we serve.\\n\\nTo help us monitor and evaluate our diversity and inclusion efforts we invite you to complete this strictly optional (and quick) survey. \\n\\nConfidentiality\\nIt is entirely up to you whether you wish to complete this survey. Any data collected is not linked to your name or job application to prevent any form of discrimination or bias. The data will not be used to make individual hiring decisions, and your decision to provide or withhold this information will not impact your application in any way.\\n\\nHow we use this information\\nAll information collected will solely be used to support our evaluation of our diversity and inclusion efforts, and to make improvements where needed. All information will be kept secure and confidential. \\n\\nThank you for taking the time to complete this survey!\\n\\nThanks,\\nMatillion Talent Acquisition Team\\n\\nOur privacy policy can be viewed here: https://www.matillion.com/privacy-policy&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;survey&quot;,&quot;fields&quot;:[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;multiple-choice&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What is your age range?&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;c59b3816-1ea1-49d0-b658-7a5366b374b8&quot;,&quot;options&quot;:[{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;18-20&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;21-29&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;30-39&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;40-49&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;50-59&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;60 or older&quot;},{&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Prefer not to say&quot;}]},{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;multiple-select&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;I identify my ethnicity as&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Select all that apply&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:false,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;d493c4a1-00f0-4ee8-97c8-71cdd